{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":34,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":34,"text":"  is told a write is in progress : no","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":35,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":35,"text":"  what it gets mid-write : whatever bytes are on disk","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":36,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":36,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":37,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":37,"text":"  an advisory lock is a convention among participants, and","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":38,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":38,"text":"  the backup is not a participant because reading was","end":"\n"}
