{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":44,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":44,"text":"  the state it produces : a mixture of before and after","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":45,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":45,"text":"    one write, which no writer ever wrote","end":"\n"}
