{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":55,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":55,"text":"  the lock did not become stronger; the reader joined the","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":56,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":56,"text":"  protocol, at a cost of one write's duration a night","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":57,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":57,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":58,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":58,"text":"what an exclusive write lock guarantees","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":59,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":59,"text":"  two writes never interleave : exactly","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":60,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":60,"text":"  a read sees a whole write   : not addressed; the lock","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":61,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":61,"text":"    binds whoever asks for it, and a reader that does not","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":62,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":62,"text":"    ask is outside the mutual exclusion by construction","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":63,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":63,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":64,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":64,"text":"advisory locking is a protocol between the parties that join","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":65,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":65,"text":"it; the question is not whether the lock works but who is in","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":66,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":66,"text":"the room, and the backup is usually written by someone else","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":67,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":67,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":68,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":68,"text":"The write lock is exclusive and its zero is measured: taken before the first","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":69,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":69,"text":"byte, released after the last, 16 concurrent writers with no interleaving,","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":70,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":70,"text":"0 torn writes in three years. It is advisory, and the nightly backup reads","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":71,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":71,"text":"without taking it, so with the path mid-write 189 per ten thousand of the day","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":72,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":72,"text":"about 6 backups a year restore a state no writer ever wrote.","end":"\n"}
